From 25f139ea445c9d4cb7a630a535fe37849acf7cfb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 00:29:47 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Carry forward Lotus release and Second Kings activation
 configuration

Carry the rebased 11.5.1 baseline, reward addresses, and Second Kings
activation plumbing into the modern source. The filename retains its
historical numbering and does not describe the resulting CMake version.
The existing 2026-12-21 replay-protection activation remains unchanged.
Two historical commits share the version-bump subject, so attribution
to either historical commit would be ambiguous.

Rationale added during metadata recovery; this is not a recovered historical
message. Author and date are retained from the recorded replay commit.
The source diff is unchanged.

Recorded-replay-commit: 2bed507b83a7275c7c59b97accdd28e2a89f6760

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
